  "notes": "This is a microbrewery and taproom, not a restaurant with traditional food service. They offer 18 rotating taps of beer, cider, seltzer, and more. The brewery features a 1.3-acre beer garden and offers cornhole, board games, and other outdoor games. Dog-friendly establishment. There is also a homebrew supply store location at 3403 Gulf Beach Hwy, Pensacola, FL 32507, phone (850) 972-8886. Store hours: Monday-Tuesday CLOSED, Wednesday-Saturday 12:00 pm - 5:00 pm, Sunday CLOSED. They offer winemaking products and grain selection for homebrewing with over 75 malted grains available and a Grain Recipe Form for ordering.",
